WEBVTT

00:00:01.020 --> 00:00:10.780
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:02.890 --> 00:00:05.150
I'm glad to hear that.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:06.100
Yeah!

00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:10.380
We made a tropical fruit mille feuille for an earlier match.

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:11.720
Would you taste it?

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:15.240
Are you sure I can eat it?

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:18.750
Team Ichigo are using different kinds of fruits, right?

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:20.730
Please let us hear your opinion!

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:23.640
They's so open.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:33.970
T-This is...

00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:39.760
Kiwi, papaya, mango...

00:00:36.470 --> 00:00:38.350
OP sequence

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:44.190
The flavours of different fruits melt in the crispness of Mille feuille.

00:00:44.190 --> 00:00:46.350
Just like a thousand waves crashing ashore!

00:00:47.650 --> 00:00:51.110
It's like I can feel your passion.

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:54.900
Really? The theme for this is "passion".

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:52.610
Yay!

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:56.700
Really?

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:01.910
Amazing. To be able to express a theme so appropriately...

00:01:01.910 --> 00:01:06.540
And the ones who made this will be our opponent for the next match.

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:16.760
Was the sweet delicious? I didn't get a bite.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:20.970
Natsuki-san and the rest are able to make such wonderful sweets easily...

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:18.720
So what is it?

00:01:18.720 --> 00:01:20.970
What fruits did they use?

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:22.970
And yet we haven't even decided on our theme.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.180
Hey! Are you listening to me!?

00:01:25.230 --> 00:01:28.400
Other than that, why did you suddenly fly away?

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:31.170
Oh, about that...

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:41.120
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:01:34.820 --> 00:01:41.120
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:46.460
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:46.460
I'll give you happiness, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:51.960
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, hapinesu made go!

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:51.960
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, Happiness made go!

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:57.130
chansu no tobira aketa toki kara kibun joujou ↑ ↑

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:57.130
Since I opened the door of chance, my mood lifted.

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:01.100
youkoso suiitsu no oukoku he

00:01:57.130 --> 00:02:01.100
Welcome to the Kingdom of Sweets.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:02.010
Bon appétit!

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:09.400
hajimehane, hetappi demo megezu ni hibishoujin<i>!</i>

00:02:02.010 --> 00:02:09.400
Though I was terrible at the beginning, I was diligent everyday<i>!</i>

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:12.020
「makeruna<i>! atashi」</i>

00:02:09.400 --> 00:02:12.020
「I won't lose<i>!</i> I said to myself」

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:13.020
Courage!

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:19.820
My dream migakeba hikaru takaramono

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:19.820
My dream when polished is a shining treasure.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.530
fairy chikara kashite<i>!</i>

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.530
Fairy, lend me your strength<i>!</i>

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:27.960
shifon, se shibon, juré, bonjuuru, hatsuratsu furuutsu, raburii made go!

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:27.960
Chiffon, C'est si bon, Gelée, Bonjour, Lively fruits, Lovely made go!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:34.050
nakitaku natte mo egao ni nareru mahou

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:34.050
Even if you cry, there is magic that can make you smile.

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:39.260
「oishii<i>!」 wo tsukurutte omoikkiri tanoshii ne</i>

00:02:34.050 --> 00:02:39.260
「Delicious<i>!</i>」 and making it wholeheartedly is fun.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:45.260
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:45.260
Fluffy, fluffy, fluffiness, so sweetly it melts.

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:50.600
shiawase wo ageru yo yumeiro no pâtishièeru<i>!!</i>

00:02:45.260 --> 00:02:50.600
I'll give happiness to you, the dream-coloured Pâtissière<i>!!</i>

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:55.150
ichigo furejie & furanbowaazu, hapihapi makaron, fun fun

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:55.150
Strawberry Fraisier & Framboise, happy happy Macaron, fun, fun

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:57.360
yume ni eeru<i>!</i>

00:02:55.150 --> 00:02:57.360
Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:01.890
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:09.650
We meet again. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:15.120
I found something amazing!

00:03:15.150 --> 00:03:16.460
What have you found?

00:03:16.460 --> 00:03:17.500
Look!

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:23.050
Could this be St. Marie's orchard?

00:03:23.440 --> 00:03:28.180
I heard that the fruits we use for lessons were all grown at an orchard in the school, but...

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:29.110
Oui!

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:31.440
I'm sure you can find some hints about the theme here, right?

00:03:31.460 --> 00:03:32.100
Yeah!

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.000
These are already changing colours!

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:36.230
Looks delicious...

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:38.850
I smelled something fragrant and it wasn't my imagination.

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:40.740
There are so many orange blossoms!

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:44.040
The apricots are almost ready to be eaten.

00:03:44.040 --> 00:03:47.070
I love fruits that are sautéed in butter!

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:51.030
Sweet, but then in the next instant, a refreshing sourness...

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:58.640
No, with normal fruits like these, we won't be able to win against Natsuki-san and her group...

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:01.220
H-Hey, Ichigo!

00:04:01.220 --> 00:04:03.970
Ichigo, wait up!

00:04:02.850 --> 00:04:03.970
Amano.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:06.010
Why are you in such a hurry?

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:07.180
Kashino!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:10.490
A while ago, I ate Natsuki-san's group's new creation!

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.060
It was incredibly beautiful and delicious.

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:17.210
Oh, they sure are steady. They'd better not be underestimating...

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:19.560
Now's not the time to laze around!

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.690
We got to look for some fruits that can stand against theirs!

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:30.010
What about these dragonfruits?

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:32.710
But these are tropical fruits too...

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:36.880
How about thinking towards the south,
Yuubari melon? Or Yamagata cherries?

00:04:36.890 --> 00:04:40.800
Even if you force yourself to think of
some ideas, nothing good will come out.

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:44.090
How can you say that!? We don't have any more time!

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.170
We've got to find something soon or else!

00:04:46.170 --> 00:04:47.010
Amano!

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.270
What!?

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:52.180
Your specialty is to make people smile.

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:55.280
And yet, now you're forgetting to smile yourself.

00:04:58.960 --> 00:05:01.630
If I'm not smiling myself...

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:05.070
I won't be able to make delicious sweets, will I?

00:05:05.070 --> 00:05:09.580
Then, how about this time, you make sweets that can bring a smile to yourself?

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:14.080
Bring me a smile?

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.580
Ichigo! Hey, hey, come over here!

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.800
Wow, there are so many strawberries!

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:24.040
It's their picking season now.

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:25.640
Amazing!

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:27.010
Let's check out over there!

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:29.510
Amongst fruits, my favourite is strawberry.

00:05:29.530 --> 00:05:32.000
Don't you think that they are cute like a little heart?

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.390
The red one is a girl in love.

00:05:34.390 --> 00:05:37.390
The pink one is a child fallen head over heels for someone.

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:39.730
The green one suffered a shock from rejection.

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.630
Why are you talking to the strawberries?

00:05:43.630 --> 00:05:46.610
Just because your name means strawberry doesn't mean they'll answer you, right?

00:05:46.610 --> 00:05:48.820
You really don't have to laugh at me...

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:51.660
Ichigo, I found something weird!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.330
Something weird!?

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:57.330
Look, it's weird, right!? They're fully grown and yet they're still white!

00:05:57.330 --> 00:05:58.670
You're right.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:03.730
You don't know!? These are "White Strawberries" which have been selectively bred recently.

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:06.090
Oh, I also saw them on the news.

00:06:06.090 --> 00:06:08.340
They stay white, even after they ripen.

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:11.200
White strawberries...

00:06:12.320 --> 00:06:13.980
So cute!

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.810
I had no idea strawberries like this existed!

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:27.440
Say, how about we make a plated dessert using red and white strawberries?

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:31.480
White hearts unify with red hearts.

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:35.010
Heart macarons, heart ice-cream and a heart pie.

00:06:35.010 --> 00:06:37.380
The theme is "a girl in love".

00:06:37.380 --> 00:06:40.580
A sweet with a slight sour flavoured strawberry hearts!

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.870
Just kidding...

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:43.670
I guess it's too much of girly romance.

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:46.760
No. That might work.

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:52.780
recipe 33

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:52.780
Strawberry Panic<i>!</i>

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.380
Red and white sweets...

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:56.700
That's pretty interesting.

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:59.500
The theme is also easily understood and cute.

00:06:59.500 --> 00:07:00.770
Hearts in love!

00:07:01.150 --> 00:07:05.020
With this, we won't lose to Team Natsuki's tropical colour.

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:07.150
The white strawberries are lovely.

00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:09.310
I'm the one who found them!

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:12.160
And who was it that called them "weird"?

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:13.190
Chocolat!

00:07:14.060 --> 00:07:17.580
But we haven't decided on our glass sweets yet.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.160
Anyway, let's try making this.

00:07:28.670 --> 00:07:29.760
How is it?

00:07:30.510 --> 00:07:33.900
The whole thing is just strawberry so it's a little monotonous.

00:07:33.900 --> 00:07:34.640
Yes...

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:37.850
I tried combining it with apples but
they don't have much of an impact.

00:07:37.860 --> 00:07:40.100
Then what should we do?

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:43.350
Let's start over by changing the texture.
Using a mousse or something...

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:45.440
Okay! Let's try it!

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:45.860
Yeah!

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:50.160
I got to figure it out... how to make the people tasting it burst into a smile!

00:07:50.160 --> 00:07:52.240
With our sweets!

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:20.390
K-K-Kashino?

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.810
Oh no, everyone fell asleep...

00:08:28.270 --> 00:08:30.820
He covered me with his own jacket.

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:36.320
The morning is still chilly.

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:42.000
Chocolate choux?

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.040
Kashino made it for me once before, didn't he?

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:50.250
With just a single sip, it sent warmth throughout my chilly body.

00:08:50.670 --> 00:08:51.670
That's it!

00:08:51.670 --> 00:08:54.430
Everyone, wake up! Wake up, I say!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:08:57.050
What is it? I was having such a good sleep...

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.430
Now's not the time to do so! You see!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:01.390
See?

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:05.640
Then it's decided. I'll handle the berries.

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:09.360
Of course I'll be the one crafting sweets, and doing the ice cream.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:11.650
I'll make the double chocolate cake.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:12.990
Then I'll...

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:14.900
You will be in charge of the macarons.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:15.860
The macarons?

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:18.160
The ones that I'm the worst at...

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:23.040
It's already difficult to bake them without burning, and the shape as well...

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:25.370
You're Team Ichigo's leader, right?

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:29.590
You will do it thousands of times, until you make a perfect macaron.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:31.430
You'll be able to do it.

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:32.090
Yes!

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:37.720
Oh, not like that, take the nozzle...

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:42.560
If everyone does their best effort, we can make the ultimate sweets, right?

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:43.640
For sure.

00:09:46.520 --> 00:09:48.480
Now it's almost time.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.280
Everyone, get inside our hats.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:54.320
Oui!

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:57.320
Preparations all set.

00:09:57.330 --> 00:10:00.370
T-Then, off to the hall!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:04.080
The exit's over that way, Leader.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:06.960
Calling me "Leader" is making me even more nervous!

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.710
Amano-san, relax, relax.

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:11.750
It'll be fine. You have practiced enough.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.630
Just do it like always.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:16.880
You're right. This time, we will set off.

00:10:18.260 --> 00:10:20.220
It's the results from the first semifinal match!

00:10:21.050 --> 00:10:24.280
Flavour: 95, Technique: 94.

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:30.000
Theme: 93, Art: 94, Performance: 95...

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:33.730
Total of 471 points, Team Tennouji wins.

00:10:33.730 --> 00:10:35.790
That's an amazingly high score.

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:39.240
If we win today, our opponents in the finals would be Team Tennouji, huh?

00:10:39.770 --> 00:10:40.740
Interesting.

00:10:40.740 --> 00:10:42.160
This means...

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.960
...winning is our only option, huh?

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:44.950
Everyone...

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:55.880
Well, we will now begin the second semifinal match of the Cake Grand Prix.

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:15.190
Team Natsuki vs...

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.650
...Team Ichigo!

00:11:18.030 --> 00:11:21.030
Just do it like always, in my own way!

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:24.160
Well then, both teams, to your stations.

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:29.200
I'm looking forward to your sweets.

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.460
Sure!

00:11:30.460 --> 00:11:31.870
Ichigo-chan!

00:11:31.870 --> 00:11:33.920
Andou-kun!

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:35.880
Rumi-san, Kana-chan.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:38.580
Andou-kun, do your best!

00:11:39.210 --> 00:11:40.380
Tennouji-san...

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:42.430
Amano.

00:11:42.930 --> 00:11:45.300
Think only about the sweets now.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:46.280
Y-Yes.

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:49.390
Right now, I got to concentrate on the match.

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:50.820
Commence cooking!

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:03.070
I heard that Ichigo-chan and the others were using red and white strawberries,

00:12:03.070 --> 00:12:05.570
but I wonder what idea they'll be using to compete?

00:12:05.570 --> 00:12:06.490
Yeah...

00:12:12.750 --> 00:12:16.210
As expected of the high school group... Their skills are good.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.100
Yeah!

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:18.550
They're making a pie too!

00:12:19.100 --> 00:12:24.130
It seems like today's match will be something interesting to see again.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.010
Yes.

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:30.050
Macarons in the shape of hearts!

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:31.680
So cute!

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.560
It's getting interesting.

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:41.050
I wonder what Ichigo-chan is doing?

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:43.650
That's...

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.280
...ice-water.

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:50.580
It's to prevent the heat from her hands from transferring to the batter...

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:53.540
Try not to touch the bag...

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:56.210
Hold the nozzle with my left hand...

00:12:57.630 --> 00:13:00.050
Have confidence! You can do it!

00:13:00.050 --> 00:13:01.130
Right!

00:13:01.630 --> 00:13:03.420
He believed in me and counted on me to do this!

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:05.510
I'm going to make the best macarons!

00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:08.680
Such faithfulness to the fundamentals.

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:10.310
To the extent of being foolishly honest.

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:11.890
Yes.

00:13:13.310 --> 00:13:17.560
But, as foolishly honest as she is... She has nothing to fear.

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.990
It's time to perform now.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:28.620
First, Team Natsuki!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:32.580
What?

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:34.620
Why did they turn off the lights?

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:37.370
What kind of performance will they do?

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:58.150
Thank you for waiting.

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:03.650
A tropical fruit mille feuille and ice cream floated on a mango sauce sweets.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:05.740
It is called "Passion's Wave."

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.950
I had no idea they could do that!

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:18.180
It's a sweet made using an abundant amount of fruits that basked in the sun of Okinawa.

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:20.440
Please have a taste.

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:25.170
Not bad, Team Natsuki.

00:14:25.170 --> 00:14:26.690
This is bad.

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:30.050
They have complete control of the atmosphere and hall at the moment!

00:14:30.050 --> 00:14:31.970
Yeah, but...

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.440
The match has only begun.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:45.730
This crispy pie carrying the melting custard cream...

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:50.160
The various fruits intertwine in my mouth and are resonating...

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:53.240
Indeed a passionate wave!

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:56.080
Yay!

00:14:56.580 --> 00:15:00.150
Then next, Team Ichigo. If you please...

00:15:13.840 --> 00:15:15.900
Red and white hearts!

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:17.640
Plus lots of strawberries!

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:19.680
How cute!

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:22.660
Anyone could do that much...

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:24.850
Wait. This isn't the end yet.

00:15:33.420 --> 00:15:34.580
Sucre filé...

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:37.040
It's a decoration made with candy!

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.300
Just like an illusion...

00:15:40.170 --> 00:15:41.280
Amano...

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.470
Welcome!

00:15:47.470 --> 00:15:51.780
Today's dessert is "Hearts in Love" focusing on strawberries.

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:53.510
Please enjoy!

00:15:56.960 --> 00:16:02.550
The crispy macaron matches the strawberry ice cream inside very well.

00:16:03.890 --> 00:16:05.710
And that's not all, is it?

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:10.190
There's a very thin layer of chocolate cream spread inside...

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:13.880
The combination of the ingredients in this verrine is superb.

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:18.870
White chocolate, milk bavarois, strawberry gelée.

00:16:18.880 --> 00:16:21.940
On top of the génoise it's covered with whipped cream and strawberries.

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:24.880
This way we wouldn't get bored of the flavour.

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:29.660
However, if I keep eating the ice cream, my tongue will freeze.

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:32.870
When that happens, please try the white heart.

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:34.880
Oh, is that so?

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:38.980
Is that framboise sauce?

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:41.810
Oh and it's still hot.

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:49.220
The hearty sauce warms into my body that was chilled while eating the ice cream...

00:16:49.830 --> 00:16:55.590
The sweetness of the white chocolate cake and the sourness of the framboise sauce are indeed wonderful.

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:58.380
Sweet and sour, with a slight bitter tone...

00:17:00.490 --> 00:17:04.490
Just when you think it's hot, it feels cool...

00:17:07.480 --> 00:17:10.890
I see. These are indeed "hearts in love"!

00:17:11.340 --> 00:17:12.260
We expressed it to him!

00:17:12.690 --> 00:17:14.550
You did it, Ichigo-chan!

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:15.970
The judging has only just started.

00:17:20.860 --> 00:17:23.600
We did all we could, right?

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:24.060
Yeah!

00:17:26.220 --> 00:17:28.210
Don't you think they're taking quite a while?

00:17:28.210 --> 00:17:29.350
Yeah...

00:17:29.350 --> 00:17:32.230
Please, no matter what, let Ichigo-chan and her group win!

00:17:33.320 --> 00:17:35.220
First, Team Natsuki.

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:38.350
Taste: 89.

00:17:38.350 --> 00:17:40.770
Technique: 91.

00:17:40.770 --> 00:17:43.260
