00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.760
Flavour: 91 points.

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:23.870
All right!

00:18:25.810 --> 00:18:27.450
To lose on flavour, we...

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:28.850
