00:18:28.850 --> 00:18:30.790
Don't worry, there's more to go.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:34.590
Next is Performance: 86 points.

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.660
I knew that the sucre filé...

00:18:36.660 --> 00:18:39.560
Don't worry, you can still make a comeback!

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:41.590
Don't mind it, Ichigo-chan.

00:18:41.590 --> 00:18:43.620
Now we're up by 9 points!

00:18:43.620 --> 00:18:44.600
See?

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:46.480
