00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:48.940
All right!

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:49.810
We did it!

00:19:52.770 --> 00:19:56.660
Amano-san, I'm looking forward to the finals.

00:19:58.370 --> 00:19:59.530
We did it!

00:19:59.530 --> 00:20:00.830
